case: 100000-character whitespace run inside a card
* bench.id: rob_hs_ff_long_whitespace_run
* bench.group: robustness
* bench.title: 100000-character run of blanks and tabs between the nodes and the value of a card
* bench.probes: v(1), v(2), i(v1)
* bench.expect: match
* bench.tags: file, hostile, scale, parser, lenient_ok
* bench.est_rss_mib: 64
* bench.note: R2 is separated from its value by 50000 blank+tab pairs (100 kB on one line) and R3 by a continuation line with the same run; the 5 V divider with R2 || R3 = 500 ohm must give v(2)=1.667 V in both tools (a tool that mishandles the run returns another value or refuses)
